{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-06_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-06","title":"握紧扶手","storyCode":"2-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-06_end.txt","sourceHash":"0ac77531203fde8236b4433113217bce4867745d5a0d2e803410fe2b851aa29f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十八关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"......说好让我表现一下的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"你太慢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都平安无事就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们该转移了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"从东边这座建筑物向下逐层移动吧，整合运动不会知道我们在哪里的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们......安全了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是的......暂时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......你脸色不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......有一点头晕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"没......什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你来龙门......多长时间了，米莎小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"一个星期......吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"一个星期......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......城市里......出现了很多怪人......然后就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道发生了什么......大家都开始跑......我也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是整合运动......整合运动攻击了切尔诺伯格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你......之前是感染者吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"但就是那几天，腿上......长出了这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......米莎？米莎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗！医疗小队！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["米莎"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克萨斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]}]}
